  history="Founded in 1936 from a merger of the United and Reform parties. It is New Zealand's main centre-right party and has led governments under Holland, Holyoake, Muldoon, Bolger/Shipley and Key/English. It won the most votes in 2023 and formed the current government with ACT and NZ First.",
