   ("Plan for young adults (23 October 2026, Luxon): a package restating earlier commitments: lower student loan repayment rates for borrowers living in New Zealand, wider access to 5% first-home deposits, paid parental leave extended from 26 to 30 weeks, compulsory KiwiSaver with higher contributions and a $1500 'Baby Boost' for newborns, more intensive employment support for long-term jobseekers, and no new taxes.", 'https://www.national.org.nz/news/20261023-young-adults'),
