   ("'No new taxes': on 23 August 2026 Luxon widened the pledge from 'no new taxes on working people' and ruled out a bank tax and a bed (accommodation) tax.", "https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/1083119/national-promises-no-new-taxes-if-re-elected"),
